# profile: openai-compatible
# @tier: 1
# @summary: Template for any other OpenAI-compatible server: vLLM, LM Studio, LiteLLM, a company gateway.
# @key: whatever the server wants, in OPENAI_API_KEY (any non-empty string if it checks nothing). Set the
#   `<set-me>` values below in .env or the shell: the profile leaves them alone and refuses to start without them.
# @cost: depends on the server; unpriced models report a null cost
# @dotnet: yes
# @verified: NOT VERIFIED. vLLM, LM Studio and LiteLLM have never been run by this repo; the wiring is the generic
#   OpenAI-compatible path (stub-tested). Confirm the model does tool calls before trusting an eval.
# @evals: live quality and safety suites through the eval CLI, capability check
# @judge: not the model under test. Suggestion only, not calibrated (D-7, M3).
# @judge-env: JUDGE_PROVIDER=openai JUDGE_MODEL=gpt-5.1
LLM_PROVIDER=openai
LLM_BASE_URL=<set-me>
LLM_API=chat_completions
LLM_MODEL=<set-me>
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=openai_compatible
EMBEDDING_BASE_URL=<set-me>
EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
EMBEDDING_DIM=1536
